<title>MACAU: Portugal's BES opens Macau bank.</title>
<headline>Portugal's BES opens Macau bank.</headline>
<dateline>MACAU 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco Espirito Santo Do Oriente said on Friday it had opened for business in the Portuguese-administered territory of Macau with a capital of 100 million patacas.</p>
<p>The Macau-based bank's majority shareholder is Banco Espirito Santo, S.A., a unit of the Group Espirito Santo of Portugal.</p>
<p>The bank would mainly deal with investment banking, consulting and &quot;multi-sourcing&quot;, a company spokesman said.</p>
<p>-- HONG KONG NEWSROOM (852) 2843 6369</p>
